<title>UK: Latam pushes IFC emerging market index up 1.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Latam pushes IFC emerging market index up 1.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Finance Corporation's composite index of emerging market equities, denominated in dollars, rose 1.1 percent to a fresh 1997 high of 327.52 at the start of play on Thursday.</p>
</text>
